    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000107 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000107">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000105"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000068"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The first few specialized divisions of an activated animal egg; Stage consisting of division of cells in the early embryo. The zygotes of many species undergo rapid cell cycles with no significant growth, producing a cluster of cells the same size as the original zygote. The different cells derived from cleavage are called blastomeres and form a compact mass called the morula. Cleavage ends with the formation of the blastula.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BILS:0000107</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BilaDO:0000006</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ChirDv:0000004</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EFO:0001290</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FBdv:00000054</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GgalDv:0000064</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HsapDv:0000005</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
