            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The epithelial layer of the lung.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>A pseudostratified epithelium, containing basal cells, stem cells of the airway, submucosal glands and cartilage rings, is limited to the trachea and large lobar airways in the mouse (Morrisey and Hogan, 2010). This more complex epithelium extends to terminal bronchioles in the human[DOI:10.1242/dev.115469]</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0001653</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:32860</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MA:0001783</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>epithelial tissue of lung</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>epithelium of lung</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>lung epithelial tissue</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>pulmonary epithelium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>UBERON:0000115</oboInOwl:id>
