        <obo:IAO_0000115>The bone forming the forehead and roof of the eye orbit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>fused in humans, paired in other animals</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000011>In the mouse the parietal originates from cephalic paraxial mesoderm (Jiang 2000; Morriss-Kay 2001), whereas in the chicken it is traced back to either mesodermal (Noden 1978) or neural crest (Couly 1992, 1993).</obo:UBPROP_0000011>
