        <obo:IAO_0000115>A substance produced by the cervix and endocervical glands[BTO]. Thick acidic mucus that blocks the cervical os after mestruation[WP]. This &apos;infertile&apos; mucus blocks spermatozoa from entering the uterus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0000242</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
