        <obo:IAO_0000115>The capitate stalk on both sides of the thorax having developed from the dorsal metathoracic wing-buds, it is freely movable and capable of vibration, representing the hind wing of Diptera; used for flight balance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>this term should be ceded to the arthropod anatomy ontology</obo:IAO_0000116>
