        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fibromuscular tubular tract leading from the uterus to the exterior of the body in female placental mammals and marsupials, or to the cloaca in female birds, monotremes, and some reptiles[WP].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Organ with organ cavity which connects the cervical canal of uterus to the vestibule of vagina.[FMA]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>The genital canal in the female, leading from the opening of the vulva to the cervix of the uterus. [TFD][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>The distal end of the oviducts differentiates as a vagina in Metatheria and Eutheria.[well established][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000007>vaginal</obo:UBPROP_0000007>
