        <owl:annotatedTarget>(In mammalian testis) Along the way (the sperm travel), three accessory sex glands, the seminal vesicle, prostate, and bulbourethral (Cowper&apos;s) gland, respectively, add their secretions as sperm move from the testes to the urethra.[well established][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
