        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cuticular covering that is composed primarily of chitin. The main structural component of arthropod cuticle is a polysaccharide, chitin, composed of N-acetylglucosamine units, together with proteins and lipids[WP].</obo:IAO_0000115>
