        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>A tuft of capillaries found in a Bowman&apos;s capsule in which waste products are filtered from the blood and urine formation is initiated. Paired highly vascularized structures of the pronephros, responsible for blood filtration.[XAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
