        <owl:annotatedTarget>The secretory units of the exocrine pancreas, where fluid containing digestive enzymes is produced; consists of a group of secretory cells surrounding a luminal space that connects to the pancreatic duct.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MP:0009145</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
