        <owl:annotatedTarget>A fused bone consisting of the ilium, ischium and pubis. Together with the sacrum and coccyx, it comprises the pelvis. [WP,modified].</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Hip_bone</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
