            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The proximal straight tubule is the part of the descending limb that extends from the proximal convoluted tubule to the descending thin tubule.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>TODO - is S3 exactly coincident with PST? todo - ensure relationships work across species (loop of Henle)</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Portion of the renal tubule which is just posterior to the proximal convoluted tubule.[TAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>UBERON:0005166</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0000055</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:29661</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
