        <oboInOwl:source>DOI:10.1098/rstb.2001.0976 Kuratani S, Nobusada Y, Horigome N, Shigetani Y, Embryology of the lamprey and evolution of the vertebrate jaw: insights from molecular and developmental perspectives. Philosophical transactions of the Royal Society of London (2001)</oboInOwl:source>
