        <obo:UBPROP_0000007>seminal</obo:UBPROP_0000007>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>Note that in this ontology, semen is defined as the sum of sperm and seminal fluid, where seminal fluid is defined in taxonomically generic way (see comments for UBERON:0006530).</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
