                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002113"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The tough fibrous layer surrounding the kidney which is covered in a thick layer of perirenal adipose tissue that functions to provide some protection from trauma and damage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000009>provides some protection from trauma and damage.</obo:UBPROP_0000009>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000010>The renal capsule relates to the other layers in the following order (moving from innermost to outermost): renal medulla renal cortex renal capsule perinephric fat (or &apos;perirenal fat&apos;) renal fascia paranephric fat (or &apos;pararenal fat&apos;) peritoneum (anteriorly), and transversalis fascia (posteriorly).[Wikipedia:Kidney_capsule]</obo:UBPROP_0000010>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:18679</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:66610</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MA:0000370</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>NCIT:C12885</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:243657006</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UMLS:C0227637</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
