            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The deepest layer of the epidermis, which is composed of dividing stem cells and anchoring cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000009>replaces damaged cells on outside of body</obo:UBPROP_0000009>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000010>consisting of non-keratinized, viable cells, in contrast to the outer (upper) layer of epidermis made up of keratinized, anucleated, non-viable cells</obo:UBPROP_0000010>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>Malpighian layer</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>rete Malphighii</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
