        <obo:IAO_0000115>The thin membranous structure between parts of the heart, including the atria, ventricles, and outflow tract.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>&apos;Terrestrial vertebrates have divided hearts in which septae separate the oxygenated and deoxygenated blood within the pulmonary and systemic circulations&apos;</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
