        <rdfs:comment>In some texts/references/ontologies, bronchiole has been used as an exact synonym of &apos;lobular bronchiole&apos;. However, a &apos;lobular bronchiole&apos; is a segment of a bronchiole.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>bronchiole</rdfs:label>
        <foaf:depiction rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/Alveoli_diagram.png</foaf:depiction>
