        <obo:IAO_0000115>The organ of Corti (or spiral organ) is the organ in the inner ear of mammals that contains auditory sensory cells, or &apos;hair cells.&apos; [WP,unvetted].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:RO_0002174 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_8292"/>
