        <oboInOwl:source>DOI:10.1111/j.1749-6632.1969.tb20447.x Ebner FF, A comparison of primitive forebrain organization in metatherian and eutherian mammals. Annals of the New York Academy of Sciences (1969)</oboInOwl:source>
        <oboInOwl:source>http://bgee.unil.ch/</oboInOwl:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
