        <owl:annotatedTarget>A transient rod-like structure which is endodermally derived and located immediately ventral to the notochord. The hypochord is thought to play a role in positioning the dorsal aorta. Eriksson and Lofberg, 2000.[TAO]</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:date_retrieved>2012-08-14</oboInOwl:date_retrieved>
