        <owl:annotatedTarget>The ectodermal precursor of the trigeminal ganglion. The profundal and the trigeminal ganglia are separate distally but fused at their proximal end as they condense around NF stage 24.[XAO]</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:ontology>XAO</oboInOwl:ontology>
