        <obo:IAO_0000115>The encapsulated adipose tissue associated with the ovaries or testes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>consider change relationship from part_of</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Anatomical structure associated with the gonads which vary in form among amphibians but are primarily composed of adipose tissue and are thought to be a source of nutrients for the gonads.[AAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>we place the amphibian structures here as their definitions state a gonadal association.</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
