        <obo:IAO_0000115>Embryonic structure that develops into pancreatic bud.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>in EHDAA2 this has dorsal and ventral primordia as parts. the buds are part of the primordium, with the ducts developing from the buds; only parenchyma and ducts have contribution from buds</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000013>revisit after standardizing terms &apos;primordium&apos;, &apos;anlagen&apos;, &apos;bud&apos;</obo:UBPROP_0000013>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EFO:0002579</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
