        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>myocardium of outflow tract</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>outflow tract cardiac muscle</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>outflow tract heart muscle</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>outflow tract heart myocardium</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
