        <obo:IAO_0000115>The central region of trunk mesoderm. This tissue forms the notochord.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Notochord rudiment[ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-576].</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>WP treats this as synonym of axial mesoderm. Induces neural tube. Gilbert: contains an anterior head process and the notochord.</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
