            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A neuron projection bundle that connects the retina or its analog in the eye with the brain. This includes the vertebrate optic nerve (not truly a nerve) as well as analogous structures such as the Bolwig nerve in Drosophila.</obo:IAO_0000115>
