        <obo:IAO_0000115>A bud-like thickening in the epidermis consisting of elongated keratinocytes, which at the distal end are in touch with numerous aggregated specialized dermal fibroblasts, the dermal condensate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>An hair follicle placode is a thickening of the ectoderm that will give rise to the hair follicle bud[GO].</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
