            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The most superficial stratum in the hippocampus. Here the perforant path fibers form synapses onto the distal, apical dendrites of pyramidal cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
