        <owl:annotatedTarget>we follow Kardong table 13.1 in having some developmental contribution of pouch 4 in mammals, but this isn&apos;t reflected in EHDAA2. Consider adding distinct term for mesenchyme (see EHDAA2), to indicate NC constribution.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:source>ISBN:0781714125</oboInOwl:source>
