        <obo:IAO_0000115>A vascular network formed by frequent anastomoses between the blood vessels (arteries or veins) of a part.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>In a vascular plexus, the contents of the vessels mix. A plexus allows blood to flow via multiple routes. If one branch of the plexus is obstructed, the blood may flow via the open branches[Wikipedia:Plexus#Circulatory_system].</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
