            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A ring of cells capable of forming a limb or paired fin[Gilbert,modified].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>we represent the field as being a part of the LPM (consistent with ZFA, Gilbert). As a consequence, the relationship between limb bud (with is ectoderm+mesenchyme) stands in a weaker has_developmental_contribution_from relation to the field - TODO implement this.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>limb/fin field of lateral plate mesoderm</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>paired limb/fin field</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
