            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An external pocketing of pharyngeal ectoderm that contacts a region of endoderm (a pharyngeal pouch) and interdigitates in the anterior and posterior directions by the pharyngeal arches.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Note we use overlaps as the relationship to the arches</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>EMAPA distinguishes between the groove ectoderm and epithelium, with the latter arising after the former</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>pharyngeal groove</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>AAO:0010623</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:32750</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
