        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000011"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>the scapula has been shown to develop from multiple tissues, such as the dermomyotome of the somites, the mesodermal portion of the soma- topleure (a domain of the lateral plate mesoderm or LPM) and neural crest cell-derived mesenchyme (Huang et al., 2000; Matsuoka et al., 2005; Wang et al., 2005).</owl:annotatedTarget>
