        <owl:annotatedTarget>The mental foramen is one of two holes (&apos;foramina&apos;) located on the anterior surface of the mandible. It permits passage of the mental nerve and vessels. The mental foramen descends slightly in edentulous individuals.</owl:annotatedTarget>
