        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pharyngeal pouch that is between pharyngeal arches 1 and 2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>. [][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>In all jawed vertebrates the first arch forms the jaw, while the second arch forms the hyoid apparatus. These two arches are separated by the first pharyngeal pouch and cleft.[well established][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000011>The endoderm lines the future auditory tube (Pharyngotympanic Eustachian tube) , middle ear, mastoid antrum, and inner layer of the tympanic membrane. &amp; origin of Mandibular nerve &amp; Maxillary artery</obo:UBPROP_0000011>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>we use adjacency relations rather than part_of, as in EHDAA2.</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
