        <owl:annotatedTarget>Third of the pharyngeal (endodermal) evaginations between the visceral arches from which the Eustachian tube is derived; pouches 2-4 open as gill slits.[AAO]</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:date_retrieved>2012-06-20</oboInOwl:date_retrieved>
        <oboInOwl:external_class>AAO:0011116</oboInOwl:external_class>
