        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pharyngeal pouch between pharyngeal arches 6 and 7.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Sixth of the pharyngeal (endodermal) evaginations between the visceral arches.[AAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>in humans pouches 5 and 6 are hard to distinguish.</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000011>Along with the fourth pouch, contributes to the formation of the musculature and cartilage of the larynx</obo:UBPROP_0000011>
