        <obo:IAO_0000115>Closed space within the ectoplacental cone, formed by the fusion of the parts of the amniotic fold that separate it from the amniotic cavity[MP]. a developmental cavity that exists in some mammals and is derived by division of the proamniotic space; it is further removed from the embryo than the amniotic cavity in some mammals.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:16080</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>epamniotic cavity</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
