        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Newly formed organic bone matrix secreted by osteoblasts, that exists prior to calcification; it is comprised mainly of type I collagen fibers, chondroitin sulfate and osteocalci[ISBN:0-683-40008-8]n</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>Note that in VSAO this was classified both as tissue and acellular extracellular matrix. Consider also the AEO class &apos;bone condensation&apos;. is_a intercellular matrix in FMA.</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
