        <owl:annotatedTarget>Segment of the leg corresponding to the tarsus. It consists of several elements that articulate with the tibia and fibula at one end and the metatarsals at the other end.[AAO]</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:date_retrieved>2012-06-20</oboInOwl:date_retrieved>
