        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>constitutes 60-70 % of the ejaculate in humans[MP]</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000009>important for semen coagulation, sperm motility, and stability of sperm chromatin and suppression of the immune activity in the female reproductive tract[MP]</obo:UBPROP_0000009>
