        <owl:annotatedTarget>An organism subdivision that includes both an appendage and its associated girdle region. Note that this includes both the skeletal elements and associated tissues (integument, muscle, etc).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/wiki/Appendages-and-the-appendicular-skeleton</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
