            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A joint that connects two adjacent metatarsals.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>In humans: The base of the first metatarsal is not connected with that of the second by any ligaments; in this respect the great toe resembles the thumb</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
