            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Highly vascular stroma found in the center of the ovary that forms from embryonic mesenchyme and contains blood vessels, lymphatic vessels, and nerves; this stroma forms the tissue of the hilum by which the ovarian ligament is attached, and through which the blood vessels enter; it does not contain any ovarian follicles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000010>composed of loose connective tissue that contains blood vessels, lymph vessels and nerves</obo:UBPROP_0000010>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:37928</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:18616</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
