            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Layer of entorhinal cortex lying superficial to layer 5 and deep to layer 3, that is relatively acellular. (Paxinos, The rat nervous system, Academic Press, 1995, pg 473-474).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>the two NIFSTD classes appear to refer to the same structure[DOI:10.1155/2008/381243]</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>NLX:39987</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>NLXANAT:1005008</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>entorhinal cortex layer IV</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
