        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A migrating group of cells originating from the posterior lateral line placode. The primordium deposits seven to nine neuromasts and interneuromasts between them during its posterior migration to the tail. Gompel et al, 2001.</obo:IAO_0000115>
